---
import HsmMapLegend from './HsmMapLegend.astro';
// Background sampling source: surface=all_bat, contrast floor 0.025, sigma=6.5 cells.
// Keep configuration details here rather than in reader-facing captions.
---

<figure class="hsm-figure">
  <div class="hsm-figure__chrome">
    <p class="hsm-figure__eyebrow">FIG. 02</p>
    <p class="hsm-figure__title">Accounting for uneven recording</p>
    <p class="hsm-figure__lede">
      We draw comparison locations more often from places that are likely to have been surveyed, rather than choosing them uniformly across the region.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="hsm-figure__frame hsm-bias">
    <div class="hsm-bias__step">
      <p class="hsm-bias__num">1</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__label">Where bats were recorded</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__meta">A closer look at South Yorkshire</p>
      <img
        src="/images/hsm/panel-bias-obs.webp"
        alt="Cropped map showing clustered bat recording intensity around towns and accessible sites."
        width="657"
        height="565"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="hsm-bias__step">
      <p class="hsm-bias__num">2</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__label">Estimated recording effort</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__meta">Based on records of all bat species</p>
      <img
        src="/images/hsm/panel-bias-effort.webp"
        alt="Cropped map of a smoothed survey-effort surface derived from all bat records."
        width="657"
        height="565"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="hsm-bias__step">
      <p class="hsm-bias__num">3</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__label">Comparison locations</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__meta">Example locations, not bat sightings</p>
      <img
        src="/images/hsm/panel-bias-background.webp"
        alt="Cropped effort surface with a subsample of background sample points denser where recording effort is higher."
        width="657"
        height="565"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hsm-bias__legend-row">
    <HsmMapLegend kind="intensity" label="Recording intensity" />
    <p class="hsm-bias__swatch"><span class="hsm-bias__dot"></span> Background locations (not bat records)</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="hsm-figure__caption">
    We use the distribution of bat records to estimate where recording effort is concentrated and guide the choice of comparison locations.
    The points in the final panel are an example, not recorded bats. This helps account for uneven coverage, but doesn't remove the bias entirely.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .hsm-figure {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .hsm-figure__chrome {
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .hsm-figure__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    color: var(--colour-rust);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .hsm-figure__title {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hsm-figure__lede {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .hsm-figure__frame {
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-rule);
    background: #f7f4ec;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__step {
    min-width: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__num {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colour-moss);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .hsm-bias__label {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hsm-bias__meta {
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__step img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-rule);
  }

  .hsm-bias__legend-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__swatch {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__dot {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--colour-rust);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .hsm-figure__caption {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hsm-figure__caption code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hsm-bias {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
